<title>GERMANY: Ruetgers swings to profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Ruetgers swings to profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   134     vs 95 loss</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    164     vs 149.2</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,872   vs 4,984</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  75	vs 145 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German chemicals group is Ruetgers AG. The group said the net profit included extraordinary income of 14 million marks. The group will not pay a dividend this year but expects to resume its dividend payments for the 1997 business year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
